      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}{}^{2n}P_{n+1}&=\\frac{(2n)!}{[2n-(n+1)]!}\\\\{}^{2n}P_{n+1}&=2n\\times\\frac{(2n-1)!}{(n-1)!}\\\\{}^{2n}P_{n+1}&=2n\\times\\frac{(2n-1)!}{[(2n-1)-n]!}\\\\{}^{2n}P_{n+1}&=2n\\times{}^{2n-1}P_n.\\end{align*}$$",
